      "message": "\u003e I\u0027d be tempted to make FULL the default everywhere\n\nDo you mean that FULL shall be the default for debugging tools (vm run, vm run-microdroid, vm_shell, ...), while NONE is the default for API call? If so, +1 to that.",
      "parentUuid": "e556e1b5_57a5c700",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 26,
